<title>USA: PMC International FY 96 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>PMC International FY 96 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	 $0.72     loss	 $0.46</p>
<p> Net	   loss	 4,024     loss	 2,444</p>
<p> Revs			10,087		    9,172</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,702		    5,547</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net income for fiscal 1996 included a $200,000 write-off related to a settlement with the Securities and Exchange Commission as compared to $465,000 for fiscal 1995.</p>
